<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 6, 2003 :: Two more epics on Sunday!</div><P>Grats Cerdiwan on your Innoruuk's Curse! I'll add a picture with the cool floaty skulls once Reide or someone with effects on sends me a link or upload or whatever! For now.. Epic Team Harm Touch at CoM! (Sorry Colwn.. models not showing you're sexiness... maybe if you didn't have a bare arm I'd be more inspired!)</P>
<P><IMG alt="Team HT wtih epics!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/teamhtepic.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>Grats Grajin on getting his Earthcaller finally! </P>
<P><IMG alt="Can slow without a shaman bot!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grajin.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Kyrt on 63!<BR>Grats Landry on 61!<BR>Grats Kusari on 50!<BR>Grats Shatta on 48!<BR>Grats Wellish on 46!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Lokki on Oct 6, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 5, 2003 :: Grats Aridius on your epic!!</div><P>Nice to see those musical notes around you!! And grats Cimmy on your new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics12/Deepwater_Breastplate.JPG">Deepwater Breastplate</A>!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.capulus.org/aridius.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P><IMG alt="Kick em while he's down!" hspace=0 src="http://www.capulus.org/aridius_epic.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Kleria on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grats Grajin on 65 and Forest Stalker!<BR>Grats Antroe on 65 and Forest Stalker!<BR>Grats Erowyn on 64!<BR>Grats Darkyn on 59!<BR>Grats Lokki on 59!<BR>Grats Vilesong on 51 and Minstrel!<BR>Grats Fahrgus on 50!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 5, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 4, 2003 :: Xanamech takes another dive!</div><P>Nice work all on killing the big metal dragon again, and getting some flags and loots for your guildies! Grats Xditilikish on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/PulsingPhaseEmitter.gif">Pulsing Phase Emitter</A>&nbsp;and Sabrena on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/innovators_ring.jpeg">Innovators Ring</A>!! And thanks Sabrena for passing your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ringoflostsoul.jpg">old ring </A>on to Shatta!! </P>
<P><IMG alt=Splat! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/xanny3.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 5, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 3, 2003 :: Zlandi, Klandi Go Down on Capulus!</div><P>Was an awesome job by all. Keep up the good work ;)</P>
<P>Grats Druentia on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/zlandicars_talisman.jpg">talisman</A> from Zland, Reide on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/zlandicars_heart.JPG">Zlandicar's Heart</A>, Jakr on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4640">Frakadar's Talisman</A> (for <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/quest.html?quest=1220">this quest</A>), and the greed winners for two <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/massive_dragonclaw_shard.jpg">Massive Dragonclaw Shards</A>!</P>
<P><IMG style="WIDTH: 420px; HEIGHT: 300px" height=523 alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.shiningindarkness.com/images/capss/zandi.JPG" width=819 align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>Grats Meeka on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Klandicar_s_Talisman.jpg">Kladicar's talisman</A>, Aridius on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/reinforced_dragonhide_breastplate.jpg">Reinforced Dragonhide Breastplate</A>, and guild bank on some spells. </P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/klandi.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Saragoth<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 1, 2003 :: Grats Kahln!</div><P>Grats on getting your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/orbofmastery.jpg">Mage Epic Goodness</A>! <BR><BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/kahln0.jpg" align=baseline border=0> </P>
<P>Grats Papajay on 65 and Overlord!!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 2, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Sep 30, 2003 :: Balut vs. Thelin</div><P>Balut came to once again rescue his evil twin Thelin from nightmares! Everyone did a great job on Hedge event, and with the help of Kithik, I actually did manage to babysit Thelin and be the only chanter there to mezz the event. Only wish our shadowknights could refresh their Harm Touch as much as Thelin /rude. </P>
<P>Grats Beryllin on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/dfpics/Veterans_Chain_Leggings.jpg">Veteran's Chain Leggings</A>, Lairiel on a Spectral Parchment, Kantar and Balut on the GREED roll for a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ribbonchoker.JPG">Ribbon Choker</A>, and Cassana on the GREED roll for a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/twisted_longbow.jpeg">Twisted Longbow</A>!</P>
<P><IMG alt="Madam Trash Heap!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/hedge.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats to Garacaius on 65 and Lord Protector!<BR>Grats Jakr on 65 and Feral Lord!<BR>Belated Grats to Garetjax on 65 and Overlord! I think I missed the big ding! <BR>Grats Aridius on 59!<BR>Grats Vilesong on 48!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 1, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Sep 28, 2003 :: Antroe gets his Earthcaller!</div>Or whatever that <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=3637">second epic blade </A>is called! Not sure he waited long enough though...&nbsp; /grins<BR><BR>Thanks to Obian for making it possible. I love my Stormwatch babes. :)<BR><BR><IMG alt="Ewww.... a ranger!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/antroe.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR><BR>Grats Corbane on 65 and Prophet! <BR>Grats Antroe on 64! <BR>Grats Hayzel on 58!<BR>Grats Lash on 56! <BR>Grats Vilesong on 47! <BR>Grats Mytee on 44!<BR><BR><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 1, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Sep 27, 2003 :: Xanny down!</div><P>So, we were&nbsp;a bit behind while we waited for FU to flag 25 or so IL folks for Behemoth and we avoided sending a raid force into PoI when there were already 100 people raiding. </P>
<P>But folks were patient, and we waited on the beach as Wonderous made groups. Thanks Jakr for babysitting the gnomer (even though we all know BOB did all the work!). Great job tanking Saragoth, and everyone did a great job surrounding the mob and not pushing it all over creation. Pinging was minimal, the clerics did their jobs awesome, and the spot healers kept everyone standing. Our only casualty was Cassana!! Damn rogues. Next time she fights with rusty daggers! </P>
<P>Grats to Papajay on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/CordHiltedSpikeDriver.gif">Cord Hilted Spike Driver</A> and Punkgurl on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/woven_shim_choker.jpeg">Woven Shim Choker</A>! </P>
<P>As usual, I took no pictures, but Divan did. So once the lazy necro comes to this site and registers (cough cough), I'll get a picture. Here's a picture from the last Xanny kill to tide folks over. <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.capulus.org/xannyold.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>After the fight, a few groups came to support Tylokki on his 8th shawl war! Okies, so many said it was just to stop him from talking... but they're mean and cranky people who show no love for the frog. /nods </P>
<P>Grats Lokki on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/blessed_coldain_prayer_shawl.jpg">shawl</A>! Grats Cimmy on an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/ice_forged_helmet.jpg">Ice Forged Helm</A> and.. um.. Grats somebody&nbsp;(Rebequa, I think!)&nbsp;on a greed roll for a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/SpikedVeliumMallet.jpg">Spiked Velium Mallet</A> (think that's the name... too lazy to look)! <BR><BR>Leveling grats to Drakshar on 65 and Prophet! <BR>Grats to Wonderbutt and Ccra on 63! <BR>Grats Sparkley, Thayet and Tylokki on 58! <BR>Grats Ghimmy on 57! <BR>Grats Shatta on 46 and planes capable! Time to set up those CH keys. /grins</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 1, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=13'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=12'>12</a> <a href='news.asp?page=13'>13</a> 14 <a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a> &nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=15'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
